  lattice:
    separator lines are single-pixel rows and columns spanning full width/height
    uniform spacing S between separators; cell_size = S-1, S in 4-6
    first separator at row/col = cell_size (full first cell)
    num_sep_rows: 2-5, num_sep_cols: 2-6
    last gap (after final separator) can be 0..cell_size (grid may be truncated)
  noise:
    marker_color pixels scattered in three zones of the input:
